     4071         "bc-mpl"
     4072         view-as alert-box error
     4073       .
     4074   define buffer old1_price-doc-forming     for ub.price-doc-forming  .
     4075   define buffer old1_price-doc-forming-gds for ub.price-doc-forming-gds  .
     4076   find first old1_price-doc-forming no-lock where
